{"overview":"وقتی ماکوتو کوننو، دختری ۱۷ ساله، توانایی «پرش» به عقب در زمان را به دست می‌آورد، بلافاصله برای بهبود نمرات و جلوگیری از حوادث شخصی اقدام می‌کند. اما به‌زودی می‌فهمد که تغییر گذشته به آن‌سادگی که به نظر می‌رسد نیست و در نهایت باید به این قدرت جدید برای شکل دادن به آیندهٔ خودش و دوستانش تکیه کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When 17-year-old Makoto Konno gains the ability to 'leap' backwards through time, she immediately sets about improving her grades and preventing personal mishaps. However, she soon realises that changing the past isn't as simple as it seems, and eventually, will have to rely on her new powers to shape the future of herself and her friends.","tagline_en":"There is a future that we can't wait for.","runtime":98,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["細田守"],"crew_en":["Mamoru Hosoda"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"仲里依紗","role":"Makoto Konno (voice)","photo":"/tqFHQiJUycuob3ytvilaAWDlbQ8.jpg","en":"Riisa Naka"},{"name":"石田卓也","role":"Chiaki Mamiya (voice)","photo":"/aHQk6XxqyJinfvrVRADEIg31nOk.jpg","en":"Takuya Ishida"},{"name":"板倉光隆","role":"Kousuke Tsuda (voice)","photo":"/mnKYU7HIsuRkx3YjdRO5FLXCdX5.jpg","en":"Mitsutaka Itakura"},{"name":"垣内彩未","role":"Yuri Hayakawa (voice)","photo":"/lUhVV9u5VGMCNdCAVhGzg8GFSdo.jpg","en":"Ayami Kakiuchi"},{"name":"谷村美月","role":"Kaho Fujitani (voice)","photo":"/xV9UrP8kZdxOiTI2efDFhp3t4iA.jpg","en":"Mitsuki Tanimura"},{"name":"関戸優希","role":"Miyuki Konno (voice)","photo":"/7LVYeFTgUpjYDrxnU7Wm5ZQUX9t.jpg","en":"Yuki Sekido"},{"name":"桂歌若","role":"Makoto's Father (voice)","photo":"/j0GXzLelO1dOzI7d1WVIwQXhLz8.jpg","en":"Utawaka Katsura"},{"name":"安藤みどり","role":"Makoto's Mother (voice)","photo":"/26R1LBiSOkkP08saSsz6LmVTY16.jpg","en":"Midori Ando"},{"name":"立木文彦","role":"Fukushima (voice)","photo":"/9nHFGrvdT5c4klZOiFQElybNy7h.jpg","en":"Fumihiko Tachiki"},{"name":"山本圭子","role":"Auntie (voice)","photo":"/4w3OVUdjzN0EpIij0gDYvnbOXx.jpg","en":"Keiko Yamamoto"},{"name":"Shiori Yokoha